---
import "../styles/global.css";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service - Striff" description="Striff Terms of Service" canonical="https://striff.io/terms">
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20">
    <h1 class="mb-8 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Terms of Service</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
      <p class="text-slate-600">Last updated: April 2026</p>

      <section class="mt-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
        <p>By accessing or using the Striff website (the "Service"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use the Service.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">2. Description of Service</h2>
        <p>Striff is a marketing and documentation website that explains structural diffs for code review. The Service provides information about Striff diagrams, their interpretation, and related tools. The Service is provided free of charge for informational purposes.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">3. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">3.1 Ownership</p>
        <p>All content on this website, including text, graphics, logos, images, and software, is the property of HADI Technology or its content suppliers and is protected by intellectual property laws.</p>

        <p class="mt-4">3.2 Striff Trademark</p>
        <p>"Striff" is a trademark of HADI Technology. You may not use the Striff name or logo without prior written permission.</p>

        <p class="mt-4">3.3 License</p>
        <p>You may view, download, and print pages from the website for personal, non-commercial purposes, provided you do not remove any copyright or proprietary notices.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">4. User Conduct</h2>
        <p>You agree not to:</p>
        <ul class="ml-6 list-disc">
          <li>Use the Service for any illegal purpose</li>
          <li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to our servers or systems</li>
          <li>Interfere with or disrupt the Service or servers connected to the Service</li>
          <li>Use automated tools to scrape or harvest data from the website</li>
          <li>Impersonate any person or entity or misrepresent your affiliation</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">5. Disclaimers</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">5.1 "As Is" Basis</p>
        <p>The Service is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis without warranties of any kind, either express or implied.</p>

        <p class="mt-4">5.2 No Warranties</p>
        <p>We do not warrant that the Service will be uninterrupted, timely, secure, or error-free. We do not warrant the accuracy or completeness of the information on the website.</p>

        <p class="mt-4">5.3 Technical Issues</p>
        <p>The website may contain technical inaccuracies or typographical errors. We reserve the right to make changes and corrections at any time without notice.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, HADI Technology shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages resulting from your use or inability to use the Service.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">7. Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>The Service may contain links to third-party websites such as GitHub. We are not responsible for the content, privacy policies, or practices of any third-party websites. We encourage you to review the privacy policies of any third-party sites you visit.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">8. Analytics</h2>
        <p>We use PostHog analytics to understand how visitors use our website. By using the Service, you consent to our collection of analytics data as described in our Privacy Policy.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">9. Termination</h2>
        <p>We reserve the right to terminate or suspend your access to the Service immediately, without prior notice, for any breach of these Terms of Service.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">10. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>These Terms of Service shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the United States. Any disputes arising under these terms shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts in the United States.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">11. Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p>We reserve the right to modify these Terms of Service at any time. We will notify users of material changes by posting the updated terms on this page and updating the "Last updated" date. Your continued use of the Service after such changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">12. Contact Information</h2>
        <p>For questions about these Terms of Service, please email us at <a href="mailto:hi@haditechnology.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700">hi@haditechnology.com</a>.</p>
      </section>
